{# SeverActions - Dirtiness : surfaces Bathing in Skyrim - Renewed dirtiness as a fourth survival need, riding in the same character_bio block SeverActions uses for hunger/sleep/cold (0170). INFORMATIVE ONLY, never directive. V2.3 anti-obsession rules: (1) a CLEAN follower (below tier 1) renders NOTHING here -- no hygiene text, no water talk, no wash suggestions (the comfort-soak stays possible as an ACTION, it is just never advertised); (2) even for a dirty follower the block is WINDOWED by the bridge -- SADirt_PromptShow is opened for ~1 minute every 10 minutes, and reopened immediately when the dirt TIER changes, so state updates always land but the LLM stops seeing hygiene in every single request. Non-followers and the player get third-person appearance only (dirt-gated as before). Brace-balanced: every block-level if/elif/else is closed. #}
{% if render_mode == "full" or render_mode == "thoughts" or render_mode == "transform" or render_mode == "action" %}
{% if is_plugin_loaded("Bathing in Skyrim.esp") %}
{% if actorUUID and actorUUID != 0 %}
{% set actor = decnpc(actorUUID) %}
{% if actor and actor.UUID %}
{% set is_companion = is_follower(actorUUID) or is_sever_follower(actorUUID) %}
{% set excluded = papyrus_util("GetIntValue", actor.UUID, "SeverActions_Survival_Excluded", 0) %}
{% if excluded == 0 %}
{% set t1 = default(get_global_value("mzinDirtinessThresholdTier1"), 0.20) %}
{% set t2 = default(get_global_value("mzinDirtinessThresholdTier2"), 0.60) %}
{% set t3 = default(get_global_value("mzinDirtinessThresholdTier3"), 0.98) %}
{% if is_player(actorUUID) %}
{% set dirt = default(get_global_value("mzinDirtinessPercentage"), 0) %}
{% else %}
{% set dirt = papyrus_util("GetFloatValue", actor.UUID, "BiS_Dirtiness", 0) %}
{% endif %}
{% if is_companion %}
{% set show = papyrus_util("GetIntValue", actor.UUID, "SADirt_PromptShow", 1) %}
{% if dirt >= t1 and show == 1 %}
{% set water = papyrus_util("GetIntValue", actor.UUID, "SADirt_WaterNearby", 0) %}
{% set soap = papyrus_util("GetIntValue", actor.UUID, "SADirt_HasSoap", 0) %}
{% set priv = papyrus_util("GetIntValue", actor.UUID, "SADirt_Private", 0) %}
## Your Hygiene
{% if dirt >= t3 %}
You are filthy. Grime and dried sweat cake your skin and clothes, and you carry a strong unwashed smell that anyone near you can notice.
{% elif dirt >= t2 %}
You are quite dirty. Your skin and clothes are visibly grubby and you have started to smell of sweat and road grime.
{% else %}
You are noticeably unwashed. A layer of dust and grime clings to you and your hair feels greasy.
{% endif %}
{% if water == 1 and priv == 1 and soap == 1 %}
There is water within reach, the spot is private, and you are carrying soap.
{% elif water == 1 and priv == 1 %}
There is private water within reach. Washing this level of grime off properly would need soap; you are carrying none.
{% elif water == 1 %}
There is water within reach, but the spot is too exposed to bathe with others around who would see you.
{% else %}
{% set wband = papyrus_util("GetIntValue", actor.UUID, "SADirt_WaterBand", -1) %}
{% set wsum = papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actor.UUID, "SADirt_WaterSummary", "") %}
{% set wnav = papyrus_util("GetIntValue", actor.UUID, "SADirt_WaterNav", 0) %}
{% if wband == 0 %}
There is no water anywhere within reach of here.
{% elif wband >= 1 and wband <= 3 and wsum != "" and wnav == 1 %}
The nearest water you know of is {{ wsum }}, with a clear way to it.
{% elif wband >= 1 and wband <= 3 and wsum != "" %}
The nearest water you know of is {{ wsum }}, though there is no clear path to it from here.
{% elif wband == 4 and wsum != "" %}
You are standing right beside the water — {{ wsum }}.
{% elif wband < 0 %}
You do not know where the nearest water is.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% else %}
{% if dirt >= t1 %}
## Physical State
{% if dirt >= t3 %}
{{ actor.name }} is filthy, streaked with grime and dried sweat, and gives off a strong unwashed smell.
{% elif dirt >= t2 %}
{{ actor.name }} is visibly dirty and has begun to smell of sweat and road grime.
{% else %}
{{ actor.name }} looks unwashed, with dust and grime clinging to skin and hair.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
